ps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273850/0f5f29b998ee39742d6de89404055c97b73ef2fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765963205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2276350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beacon Patrol is a <strong>cooperative and relaxing</strong> tile laying <strong>exploration game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as captain of the Coast Guard, <strong>navigating the coast</strong> of the North Sea to secure its beacon buoys, lighthouses and waterways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work together</strong> with your friends and <strong>score points</strong> by creating the most complete map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the <strong>full board game experience</strong>, including the Ships &amp; Shores expansion, as well as the <strong>digitally exclusive</strong> Endless Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273850/extras/102fdc32491dbcfeb9e2bac83b01cdb4.avif?t=1765963205\" width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start at the Coast Guard HQ and build your own coastal map from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn you place up to three tiles, connecting to your ship\u2018s current location. Your ship immediately moves onto the newly placed tiles and you can spend tokens for additional movement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273850/extras/4705d446a70bbdd05b3885a4baa93189.poster.avif?t=1765963205\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273850/extras/4705d446a70bbdd05b3885a4baa93189.webm?t=1765963205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273850/extras/4705d446a70bbdd05b3885a4baa93189.mp4?t=1765963205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange a tile with another player or hold onto it for the next turn when playing solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game ends when all tiles have been played. Explore tiles to score points and receive new tiles to keep on playing beyond the horizon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273850/extras/3839ded26db3ac895a08b9880236c300.avif?t=1765963205\" width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Beacon Patrol offers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy and relaxing coastal exploration </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or co-op with your friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic tile placement </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full board game experience including the Ships &amp; Shores expansion </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value - every game is different  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new ships, tiles, seagull companions and more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online multiplayer via Steam Remote Play Together </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digitally exclusive content and game modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look and feel of a modern board game featuring a clear and cute art style </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Beacon Patrol does not offer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive Gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat &amp; Violence </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273850/extras/8aa0e0e6ea9704b3f8ff00cbe54868a6.avif?t=1765963205\" width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore to receive additional tiles and play as long as you can keep scoring. Unlock new tiles and ships for even longer and more adventurous journeys. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Board Game Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a faithful adaptation of the Beacon Patrol board game including the Ships &amp; Shores expansion. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creative Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the coastline at your own pace with unlimited tiles and movement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273850/extras/da4df8808d8addb9f935f72b3a691826.avif?t=1765963205\" width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273850/extras/e0889a637069b8fa3f61a30181186daf.avif?t=1765963205\" width=1560 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ship comes with unique abilities that can aid you in navigating the waters ahead. But beware, they require expert hands to operate.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tiles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273850/extras/a9c12a5609468fa1a4c19d83b67b3a6f.avif?t=1765963205\" width=1560 height=321 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New tiles allow you to create even bigger more varied maps with synergies and scoring opportunities to figure out.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seagulls, Maps &amp; Flags</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273850/extras/78ffd1ceec99dfca11b1116fa8b10ff5.avif?t=1765963205\" width=1560 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your flag and select a cute seagull companion to accompany you on your chosen map.</p>","developers":["Shapes and Dreams","BrutalHack"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273850/3041b9dc1f308ce812d6e9f21b8c62cf335f83c5/header.jpg?t=1765963205","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 or higher (or similar)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1Ghz Intel or AMD (x64) Processor with SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> If you have issues running the game, please contact us. We have some Linux knowledge, but not many test devices.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong