elaxing tile laying exploration game. You play as captains of the Coast Guard, navigating the coast of the North Sea to secure its beacon buoys, lighthouses and waterways. Work together with your friends and score points by creating the most complete map.","steam_appid":2273850,"support_info":{"email":"contact@shapesanddreams.com","url":"https://shapesanddreams.net"},"supported_languages":"English, German, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, French","type":"game","website":"http://www.beaconpatrol.com"}